commit 760c60aea898263cd574c7f45aa1554df78d8c75
Author: Robert Schilling <rschilling@rivosinc.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 15 13:57:50 2024 +0100

    [hw,keymgr_dpe,rtl] Remove flash seed input as not used currently

    The flash seed input pulls in the flash_ctrl_pkg, which is ip-gened.
    Darjeeling, who is the only user of keymgr_dpe by now, does not have
    a flash_ctrl and so it does not use the flash seed input. To remove
    the dependency of flash_ctrl, remove the flash seed input from
    keymgr_dpe

    Signed-off-by: Robert Schilling <rschilling@rivosinc.com>

diff --git a/hw/ip/keymgr_dpe/rtl/keymgr_dpe.sv b/hw/ip/keymgr_dpe/rtl/keymgr_dpe.sv
