commit 58c6d26efaaf7d04000b633b1626e7e711ed1a07
Author: Pascal Nasahl <nasahlpa@lowrisc.org>
Date:   Thu Oct 3 14:48:28 2024 +0000

    [kmac/dv] Add sideload_invalid test.

    This commit adds the new sideload_invalid test. The goal of this test
    is to increase coverage of the `StKeyMgrErrKeyNotValid` state of
    the kmac_app FSM.

    In the test, during a random FSM state, the sideload_key.valid signal
    is forced to 0. The test checks whether the expected `ErrKeyNotValid`
    error is seen.

    Signed-off-by: Pascal Nasahl <nasahlpa@lowrisc.org>

