commit 0fcc9e8820138663a20c5d860d590aaa8117b8a0
Author: Robert Schilling <rschilling@rivosinc.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 6 00:24:09 2023 -0800

    [hw,dma,rtl] Remove FlashAddr address space from ASIDs

    This address space was originally designed to map external flash to
    the CTN address space and perform MMIO accesses to read/write flash.
    As we are now using the OT-internal SPI-host to access the flash via
    ordinary peripheral access, e.g., use the device in hardware handshake
    mode, the flash address space becomes obsolete.

    Signed-off-by: Robert Schilling <rschilling@rivosinc.com>

