Author: Alexander Williams <awill@opentitan.org>
Date:   Fri Apr 5 17:33:15 2024 +0000

    [i2c] Add configurable policy for target address NACK

    Optionally allow NACKing the address byte on a stretch timeout, in case
    there are applications where this is meaningful. Add a branch of states
    to handle stretching on the ACK bit for the address, just like there are
    for data bytes.

