commit 9d94535beb40b2b377a0c4ef99b6b88fa250df3d
Author: Andreas Kurth <adk@lowrisc.org>
Date:   Tue Feb 27 09:54:00 2024 +0000

    [i2c] Add AcqFifoDepth parameter

    This commit splits the depth of the ACQ FIFO from the `FifoDepth`
    parameter into a separate, new parameter named `AcqFifoDepth`.  This
    allows instantiators making the ACQ FIFO of all `i2c` instances deeper
    or shallower than the other FIFOs.

    For now, the new parameter is set to 64, which is equal to the value of
    the `FifoDepth` parameter.

    Signed-off-by: Andreas Kurth <adk@lowrisc.org>

