commit 06bd80209207feb7817898a4e4772b48e0b789f7
Author: Michael Schaffner <msf@opentitan.org>
Date:   Tue Feb 6 15:06:24 2024 -0800

    [otp_ctrl] Add second HW_CFG partition

    This replicates a change that has been implemented on integrated_dev.
    In particular, this splits the HW_CFG partition into two partitions
    HW_CFG0 and HW_CFG1, where HW_CFG0 only contains the DEVICE_ID and
    MANUF_STATE, and HW_CFG1 contains debug-related chicken switches.

    This is intended to make the partition layout more amenable to the
    intended provisioning flow, since these partitions can now be locked
    independently and at different times during the flow.

    Signed-off-by: Michael Schaffner <msf@opentitan.org>

