Author: Alexander Williams <awill@opentitan.org>
Date:   Fri Jan 12 17:36:56 2024 -0800

    [spi_device] Remove all timing mode CSRs

    spi_device only supports mode 0 now, so eliminate the CSRs for changing
    modes. The TPM spec requires mode 0, and SPI passthrough is unable to
    support other modes as well.

    Signed-off-by: Alexander Williams <awill@opentitan.org>

