Date:   Tue Apr 25 14:01:19 2023 +0200

    [entropy_src] Define ObserveFifoDepth parameter in hjson

    Previously, RTL and DV had separate definitions of this parameter. In
    addition, the hjson is using hard coded bit widths for the
    OBSERVE_FIFO_DEPTH and OBSERVE_FIFO_THRESH CSRs. Therefore it's cleaner
    to have only one parameter defintion and move that into the hjson
    together with a comment saying that these bit widths always have to
    be manually updated.

    Signed-off-by: Pirmin Vogel <vogelpi@lowrisc.org>

