commit e4699b52f296ed46f652182bf40885dfa13edbaa
Author: Timothy Chen <timothytim@google.com>
Date:   Thu Dec 1 19:00:39 2022 -0800

    [i2c] re-name interrupts

    - rename tx_empty to tx_stretch.
      This reflects the new behavior where tx is stretched not just because
      there is no data, but also because an unhandled write transaction may be
      waiting.

    - rename trans_complete to cmd_complete
      This aligns the design to the spec, since a transaction is usually
      start -> stop, whereas a command is start -> restart / stop.

    Signed-off-by: Timothy Chen <timothytim@google.com>

