commit 08844b9d7cecd3c04ccff741082bded3d296f6fb
Author: Greg Chadwick <gac@lowrisc.org>
Date:   Mon Oct 24 20:18:05 2022 +0100

    [dv] Make escalate test stimulus more targeted

    This tweaks how we decide when to send escalate stimulus to more easily
    hit different otbn_start_stop_control FSM transitions.

    Signed-off-by: Greg Chadwick <gac@lowrisc.org>

diff --git a/hw/ip/otbn/dv/tracer/rtl/otbn_trace_if.sv b/hw/ip/otbn/dv/tracer/rtl/otbn_trace_if.sv
index 8742027a90..934ad4b1c1 100644
--- a/hw/ip/otbn/dv/tracer/rtl/otbn_trace_if.sv
