commit e4116b590bb573a35f51cfff9889a2fe336fd2d8
Author: Michael Schaffner <msf@google.com>
Date:   Tue Sep 27 19:57:37 2022 -0700

    [rv_dm] Declare RV_DM debug memory as RW region

    Since the RV_DM debug memory contains both writeable and readable regions,
    the corresponding window in rv_dm.hjson needs to be marked accordingly.

    Note that that window is only a stub and cannot be used to build an accurate
    RAL model (we model the memory and registers inside rv_dm more accurately
    in rv_dm_debug_mem.hjson for simulation purposes).

    Signed-off-by: Michael Schaffner <msf@google.com>

