commit b74f395eb44d1146b6282ef22ec97c4e1007f3c1
Author: Pirmin Vogel <vogelpi@lowrisc.org>
Date:   Fri Aug 26 17:28:23 2022 +0200

    [otbn] Let fatal error signal from start-stop controller stay asserted

    Previously, the fatal error signal would remain high for just one clock
    signal for some error sources while staying asserted for others. This
    commit changes the behavior to always stay asserted until reset.

    Signed-off-by: Pirmin Vogel <vogelpi@lowrisc.org>

