commit 38ed2bc76163b3ff3e45bc46acf2b8d8822bdfdd
Author: Eunchan Kim <eunchan@opentitan.org>
Date:   Tue Apr 12 10:10:35 2022 -0700

    [spi_device] Add payload overflow interrupt

    this commit adds `upload_payload_overflow` interrupt to SPI_DEVICE IP.

    The event occurs when a SPI Host system issues a command having more
    than 256B payload. HW overwrites the previous payload when this happens,
    so that SW should read the last written payload index (To be
    implemented) to get the start address of the last 256B buffer.

    [spi_device] Re-generate SPI_DEVICE CSR

    [spi_device] Add Inter logic and port

    Add `upload_payload_overflow` interrupt port to the SPI_DEVICE IP with
    the interrupt generation logic.

    [top] Re-generate TOP for added interrupt.

    [spi_device] Autogen DIF

    [plic] Add SPI_DEVICE Interrupt to the unittest

    [spi_device] Revise TB to add payload overflow interrupt port

    [spi_device] Add interrupt port to Upload unit test

    Signed-off-by: Eunchan Kim <eunchan@opentitan.org>

