commit 746cce3d17128699b4bfab4a8ed559bac6e092e5
Author: Prajwala Puttappa <prajwalaputtappa@lowrisc.org>
Date:   Thu Feb 24 14:46:25 2022 +0000

    [rom_ctrl, dv] Updated sec_cm_testplan and added requirements to meet V2s

    Following changes have been made in this commit:

    1. Mapped all the security testpoints to existing/ new testcases and filled
    the gaps in security testing.
    2. Edited the checklist to reflect current DV status for V2S.
    3. Added coverage point for Mubi signals.
    4. Added a branch inside rom_ctrl_corrupt_sig_fatal_chk_vseq to test CheckerCTrlFlowConsistency.
    5. Fixed nightly regression failure in rom_ctrl_kmac_err_chk by adding
    more delay while expecting fatal error to fire.
    6. Added an assertion to check bus local escalation countermeasure.

    Signed-off-by: Prajwala Puttappa <prajwalaputtappa@lowrisc.org>

