    Signed-off-by: Michael Schaffner <msf@opentitan.org>

diff --git a/hw/ip/prim/dv/prim_esc/tb/prim_esc_tb.sv b/hw/ip/prim/dv/prim_esc/tb/prim_esc_tb.sv
