commit c109f96be03b34bd86327e96de20ffb79115c9f0
Author: Mark Branstad <mark.branstad@wdc.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 29 11:38:29 2021 -0700

    [entropy_src/sec] entropy bus check to recov alert

    A check was added to make sure consective entropy bus values do not match.
    If matching, it is most likely an attacker is forcing the values.
    Since it is a statistical check, a fail is forwarded to the recoverable alert.
    Added an interrupt for this check also.

    Signed-off-by: Mark Branstad <mark.branstad@wdc.com>

