Author: Mark Branstad <mark.branstad@wdc.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 23 08:49:51 2021 -0700

    [entropy_src/rtl] ast rng interface enable change

    The ast rng interface signal rng_en was being treated by the rtl as a ready signal to work better with the DV model.
    The ast rng rtl model treats this signal as a reset input.
    The ready logic has been removed to avoid constant resets of the ast rng model.

    Signed-off-by: Mark Branstad <mark.branstad@wdc.com>

