commit ed81ae1e127a122e1188014c036c9778cc2aaa0d
Author: Michael Schaffner <msf@opentitan.org>
Date:   Fri Jul 16 16:40:42 2021 -0700

    [otp_ctrl/lc_ctrl] Add MANUF_STATE to HW_CFG and expose through LC TAP

    This adds an additional 256bit MANUF_STATE field to the HW_CFG OTP
    partition, and exposes it through a life cycle CSR which will be
    accessible through the life cycle TAP.

    This field is intended for manufacturing state tracking purposes only,
    and has no other functional connections to other HW blocks.

    Signed-off-by: Michael Schaffner <msf@opentitan.org>

