commit 4d8199fb8505236617287c1b22d45bb64e87534c
Author: Michael Schaffner <msf@opentitan.org>
Date:   Tue May 25 18:20:19 2021 -0700

    [top] Change otp_hw_cfg struct field breakout connections

    This changes how the individual OTP HW CFG struct fields are broken out
    in the top-level. Specifically, instead of importing the entire
    partitition struct into each consumer IP, only the bits used within an
    IP are actually connected to that IP.

    This requires some additional manual connections in the top-level
    template, since the topgen/intersig does not yet support individual
    struct field connections.

    Signed-off-by: Michael Schaffner <msf@opentitan.org>

diff --git a/hw/ip/csrng/rtl/csrng.sv b/hw/ip/csrng/rtl/csrng.sv
